<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS9" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Selecting and Merging: Towards Adaptable and Scalable Named Entity Recognition with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.9 </span>Finer Adaptation for Target Domains</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS10" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Selecting and Merging: Towards Adaptable and Scalable Named Entity Recognition with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.10 </span>Analysis of Merging Technique</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS11" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Selecting and Merging: Towards Adaptable and Scalable Named Entity Recognition with Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.11 </span>Comparing with Self-Consistency</span></a></li>
